、「副大臣宇戦団視察🔎」 https://t.co/o6NUL6wwmu","id_str":"2105960999362658530","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":73,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[149,154],"text":"宇宙安保"},{"indices":[155,169],"text":"SDF_SpaceYear"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDU5NjA5OTkzMTY1NjYwMTc=","text":"【🛰防衛×宇宙🚀シリーズ㉚】\n第30弾は、「副大臣宇戦団視察🔎」\n \n10月1日、小田原防衛副大臣は、東京・府中基地所在の航空自衛隊宇宙作戦団を視察しました。宇宙作戦団は、宇宙状況把握システムや衛星妨害状況把握装置を運用しており、現地では部隊編成や任務、宇宙の監視状況などの説明を受けました🛰\n \n#宇宙安保\n#SDF_SpaceYear"}}},"rest_id":"2105960999362658530","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"59624","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2108456800215617714","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"19614","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2108456800215617714","sortIndex":"2108483978750066666"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":144,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2106458541330726912/3Vr7hldn?format=png&name=144x144_2","width":144},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.fsa.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":400,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2106458541330726912/3Vr7hldn?format=png&name=420x420_2","width":400},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":400,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/21064